WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.708
Most problems in the contact center are a missing permission, a missing setup

00:00:05.708 --> 00:00:08.375
record, or a phone that is not signed in.

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:11.211
This video follows the troubleshooting page:

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:14.161
find the symptom, and work through its checks.

00:00:14.161 --> 00:00:19.380
It shows the screens where problems are diagnosed, and uses slides for the checklists.

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:27.724
Find your symptom, and work through its checks in order.

00:00:27.724 --> 00:00:31.830
When a check needs your administrator or IT, the page says so.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.457
Most problems come down to three things.

00:00:35.457 --> 00:00:40.960
A permission is missing, a setup record is missing, or the phone is not signed in.

00:00:45.147 --> 00:00:48.236
Check the page for that task in the manual:

00:00:48.236 --> 00:00:52.774
a table at the top names the menu, the permission and the feature.

00:00:52.774 --> 00:00:57.438
Without the permission, or with the feature off, the menu is hidden.

00:00:57.438 --> 00:01:01.157
A role's permissions are under Access Control, Roles.

00:01:01.612 --> 00:01:04.029
Some buttons need a site setting.

00:01:04.029 --> 00:01:09.049
Pause recording appears only when Allow agents to pause recording is on, in

00:01:09.049 --> 00:01:11.218
the Recording governance tab.

00:01:11.218 --> 00:01:17.912
Collect data securely needs Enable agent-assisted secure data capture, in the Secure Data Capture tab.

00:01:18.364 --> 00:01:23.369
The Diagnostics tab of the soft phone appears only when the administrator enables

00:01:23.369 --> 00:01:26.764
it, in the soft phone settings of Telephony settings.

00:01:28.364 --> 00:01:31.517
Some buttons appear only at the right moment.

00:01:31.517 --> 00:01:36.215
Listen, Whisper and Barge show on an agent's card only while the agent

00:01:36.215 --> 00:01:37.389
is on a call.

00:01:37.389 --> 00:01:41.593
Complete activity shows once there is an activity to complete.

00:01:41.593 --> 00:01:46.724
And the Agent role does not include the soft phone permission, so ask for it.

00:01:50.915 --> 00:01:55.979
The live dashboard and the shared voicemail show only the queues and campaigns

00:01:55.979 --> 00:02:00.079
on your own agent entitlement record, even for administrators.

00:02:00.079 --> 00:02:05.385
Here the dashboard is empty, because this administrator has no entitlement record.

00:02:05.838 --> 00:02:09.135
The same rule applies in the Work tab of the soft phone.

00:02:09.135 --> 00:02:12.911
You sign in only to the queues and campaigns you are entitled to,

00:02:12.911 --> 00:02:17.378
so when one is missing, ask your manager to add it to your entitlement record.

00:02:18.978 --> 00:02:21.859
An empty activity list is often a filter.

00:02:21.859 --> 00:02:27.192
Activities lists only manual activities assigned to you that are not started yet,

00:02:27.192 --> 00:02:32.158
so unassigned dialer work and automated AI activities are not listed there.

00:02:32.908 --> 00:02:37.282
An empty report is usually the date range, which starts on today.

00:02:37.282 --> 00:02:42.210
Pick a longer range, clear the queue, agent or campaign filters, and check

00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:44.428
that you may view the reports.

00:02:48.602 --> 00:02:50.236
Open My workspace.

00:02:50.236 --> 00:02:53.573
It shows Connected while live updates work.

00:02:53.573 --> 00:03:00.792
With Reconnecting or Disconnected, new offers do not appear until it reconnects, so reload the page.

00:03:02.392 --> 00:03:05.393
Is the phone app running and signed in to the site?

00:03:05.393 --> 00:03:09.079
The Windows app keeps running in the tray, and calls do not ring

00:03:09.079 --> 00:03:10.554
after you choose Quit.

00:03:10.554 --> 00:03:13.292
Are you signed in to the queue, and Available?

00:03:14.042 --> 00:03:15.444
Is the queue open?

00:03:15.444 --> 00:03:19.241
Routing pauses while its business hours calendar is closed.

00:03:19.241 --> 00:03:24.382
Is the number routed to your queue, and do you have the skills the queue requires?

00:03:25.132 --> 00:03:30.936
An offer rings for 30 seconds by default, then follows the queue's unanswered-offer action.

00:03:30.936 --> 00:03:35.782
If your state became Away with the reason Phone unreachable, check the soft

00:03:35.782 --> 00:03:38.235
phone, then set yourself Available.

00:03:38.235 --> 00:03:40.329
Does nothing ring for anyone?

00:03:40.329 --> 00:03:42.064
Ask your administrator:

00:03:42.064 --> 00:03:46.492
with Telnyx, calls are rejected until the Webhook public key is set.

00:03:50.692 --> 00:03:54.884
Check that the browser allows the microphone, and click Retry microphone.

00:03:54.884 --> 00:03:59.182
Pick the Microphone and the Speaker with the headset button, and check that

00:03:59.182 --> 00:04:01.252
the call is not muted or on hold.

00:04:02.845 --> 00:04:09.185
When the Diagnostics tab is enabled, click Run audio test, and share the result with support.

00:04:10.785 --> 00:04:14.712
A Poor connection badge means your network is struggling.

00:04:14.712 --> 00:04:19.574
Move closer to the Wi-Fi, use a wired connection, or try another Region.

00:04:19.574 --> 00:04:22.378
Is the audio still silent for everyone?

00:04:22.378 --> 00:04:27.365
Ask your administrator, because it is often a network or firewall setting.

00:04:31.565 --> 00:04:33.677
Texts not sent or received?

00:04:33.677 --> 00:04:40.332
The number must be on Omnichannel Addresses with Text messages ticked, and the right SMS provider.

00:04:40.332 --> 00:04:44.939
A customer who texted stop gets no messages until they text start.

00:04:44.939 --> 00:04:46.859
Missing from your inbox?

00:04:46.859 --> 00:04:49.035
Check the Unassigned filter.

00:04:49.785 --> 00:04:51.539
The AI does not answer?

00:04:51.539 --> 00:04:55.290
The entry point must be open, and Route to must be an AI

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:57.347
agent with a profile picked.

00:04:57.347 --> 00:05:01.522
Calls to an AI entry point are refused when the Telnyx AI Voice

00:05:01.522 --> 00:05:03.155
Agent feature is off.

00:05:03.155 --> 00:05:07.874
On an automatic load, check that it reached Loaded, and that the contact

00:05:07.874 --> 00:05:09.205
did not opt out.

00:05:13.388 --> 00:05:17.581
The live dashboard has a panel named Why isn't this dialing.

00:05:17.581 --> 00:05:20.186
It says what holds a campaign back.

00:05:20.186 --> 00:05:23.998
Here it says that no work is waiting to be dispatched.

00:05:25.598 --> 00:05:28.983
Are agents signed in to the campaign and Available?

00:05:28.983 --> 00:05:33.436
The dialer calls only for available agents signed in to the campaign.

00:05:33.436 --> 00:05:35.574
Is the dialer profile enabled?

00:05:35.574 --> 00:05:38.008
A disabled profile places no calls.

00:05:38.758 --> 00:05:40.701
Is the calling window open?

00:05:40.701 --> 00:05:45.118
A closed calendar means the records are tried again in a later cycle.

00:05:45.118 --> 00:05:47.827
Has the abandonment cap stopped dialing?

00:05:47.827 --> 00:05:49.181
Are records left?

00:05:49.181 --> 00:05:50.948
Check Manage Activities.

00:05:55.148 --> 00:05:56.486
Stuck in wrap-up?

00:05:56.486 --> 00:05:58.116
Complete the activity:

00:05:58.116 --> 00:06:00.734
pick a disposition, and click Complete.

00:06:00.734 --> 00:06:04.749
If you leave it open, wrap-up ends on its own after 15 minutes,

00:06:04.749 --> 00:06:07.368
unless your administrator changed that.

00:06:08.118 --> 00:06:09.867
Cannot find a contact?

00:06:09.867 --> 00:06:14.677
Search by name or number, try fewer digits, and remember that leads are

00:06:14.677 --> 00:06:16.738
listed apart from contacts.

00:06:17.488 --> 00:06:20.196
A load did not create what you expected?

00:06:20.196 --> 00:06:26.201
Read the load's report, which counts every matching record that was not loaded, with the reason.

00:06:26.201 --> 00:06:29.144
A load cannot be edited once it has started.

00:06:29.144 --> 00:06:30.498
Create a new one.

00:06:34.698 --> 00:06:39.238
Write down what you did, what you expected, what happened, and the time,

00:06:39.238 --> 00:06:41.566
and send it to your administrator.

00:06:41.566 --> 00:06:46.281
IT and support teams have the runbooks, the production support page and the

00:06:46.281 --> 00:06:48.958
telephony pages in the technical manual.

00:06:50.958 --> 00:06:55.390
Find the symptom, check the permission, the setup record and the phone, and

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:58.125
ask your administrator when a check says so.

00:06:58.125 --> 00:06:59.548
Thanks for watching.

